## Design (1B dense-equivalent MoE)

**d=1536, L=16, ffn_dim=6144 (mult 4), vocab=32k, E=16, top_k=2, cf=1.25**

Validated with the skill formulas:
- Dense baseline = 16·(4·1536² + 3·1536·6144 + 2·1536) + 32k·1536 = **653M**
- Activated = 16·(9.44M + 3.07k + 2·28.31M) + 49.15M = **1.11B** (the ~1B dense-equivalent)
- MoE total = 16·(9.44M + 3.07k + 16·28.31M) + 49.15M = **7.45B** (param_ratio 11.4×)
- FLOPs/token = 6·1.11B + 4·16·1536·2048 = **6.84 GFLOPs** (1.66× dense)

Memory per GPU (EP=8 shards experts, ZeRO optimizer, grad-checkpointing on): params 2.2GB + grads 2.2GB + optimizer 13.3GB + activations ~4.0GB + overhead ≈ **26GB** of 80GB (~68% headroom). Throughput ≈ 85k tok/s at ~25% MFU on 8×A100-80GB. Tokens/expert/GPU/micro-batch = 8·2048·2/2 = **16,384** (≫ 8–64 floor → no underutilization).

