**Rationale for choices:** 16 experts keeps the memory-safe ~7B-total/1B-active profile (64 experts would balloon total params to ~27B and push per-GPU memory near the 80GB limit on 8 GPUs). Top-2 over Top-1 trades 2× dispatch cost for the quality floor the skill documents; cf=1.25 + aux loss 0.01 is the recommended load-balancing default. All counts follow the skill's calculator formulas and should be re-verified with `tools/moe_calculator.py` / `tools/memory_estimator.py` before launch.